  "releaseNotes": "- Performance: `HtmlCharRefs` entity lookup now uses a `Dictionary<string, string>` instead of an F# `Map`, giving O(1) lookups instead of O(log n) for ~2230 HTML named-entity entries. Also avoids a repeated `char[]` allocation in the `TrimEnd` call inside the active pattern.",
